'''Icefiends''' are [[demons]] made of ice and freezing rock{{CiteNPC|npc=Slayer Master|quote=Icefiends are beings of ice and freezing rock, they're quick and agile but weak to fire spells.|loc=|notes=|name=}} found on top of the [[Ice Mountain]], in various locations around [[Varlamore]], the southern part of the [[God Wars Dungeon]], and summoned during fights with the [[Ice demon]] in the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. Killing an icefiend is one of the three options to cool down the [[Dwarven rock cake]] in [[Recipe for Disaster]].

